  "comments": "1982-1988 minted at Leningrado<br />\r\n1998-date minted at La Habana<br /><br />\r\nThis coin page was split from KM# 33.1 cause we understood the change of motto legend makes it more than a variant. On their side, Krause considers them as variants.<br /><br />\r\nMain variant differences:<br />\r\nObverse:<br /><br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/58c7e49e7c7f8.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/58c7e49e7c7f8.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"199\" height=\"100\" /></a><br /><br />\r\nLeft is for 33.1 &amp; 33.2; right is for 33.3<br />\r\nOn newer design branches are shorter and are closer to shield, strip lines on bottom left of shield are more separated, and the plain ones are depressed; less detailed shield and dots between legends are bigger.<br /><br />\r\nReverse:<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5b8215671ab27.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5b8215671ab27.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"111\" /></a><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5b82157c41323.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5b82157c41323.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"114\" /></a><br />\r\nOn left: 33.1 reads &quot;PATRIA Y LIBERTAD&quot;;<br />\r\nOn right: 33.2 &amp; 33.3 read &quot;PATRIA O MUERTE&quot;<br /><br />\r\nKnown variations on year issues:<br />\r\n2008: smaller date",
